---
import FullNavigationLayout from "../../astro/layouts/FullNavigationLayout.astro";

const example = `<details>
  <summary>Advanced options</summary>
  <p>Content uses the browser's native disclosure behavior.</p>
</details>`;
---

<FullNavigationLayout>
  <main class="mr-container mr-shell__main">
    <h1>Details disclosure</h1>
    <p>
      Scoped base styles refine native <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;summary&gt;</code>
      without replacing their disclosure semantics or requiring JavaScript.
    </p>
    <pre data-mr-copyable><code>{example}</code></pre>
    <Fragment set:html={example} />
    <p>
      The native <code>open</code> attribute is the source of truth. Components such as
      <a href="../clickable-item-list/">Clickable Item List</a> may observe native disclosure
      state, but the underlying element remains usable without enhancement.
    </p>
  </main>
</FullNavigationLayout>
